Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.21,0:00:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小步跑  来集合点见我们\N{\rEng}How double time it, and meet us at the rally point?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了后用对讲机通知我们\N{\rEng}Radio back as soon as you're on post.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们继续往东走\N{\rEng}Let's just keep pushing east.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们来杀我们了\N{\rEng}They are coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见两个人\N{\rEng}Got a visual on two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这一刻过来了\N{\rEng}Coming for us at this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群嗜血流氓和顽固不化的凶手\N{\rEng}A powerful force of bloodthirsty rogues
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,组成的强大力量\N{\rEng}and unrepentant cutthroats
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决心要无情地消灭我们\N{\rEng}bent on nothing short than our pitiless destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离大概50码\N{\rEng}...about 50 yards, on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我依然在笑\N{\rEng}And yet I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但卡萝尔依然在笑\N{\rEng}And yet Carol smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:47.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么  老大\N{\rEng}Why, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们也许人多势众\N{\rEng}They probably have the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们足智多谋\N{\rEng}But we have strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.66,0:01:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.09,0:02:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心怀希望\N{\rEng}I am binding a hope to my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许这不明智\N{\rEng}perhaps unwisely...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.73,0:02:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们已经走了这么远\N{\rEng}but we have come this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.17,0:02:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们所有人依然在\N{\rEng}all of us, still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.57,0:02:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们遵守计划  遵循训练\N{\rEng}If we follow this plan, if we keep to our training,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果命运继续眷顾我们\N{\rEng}if the fates continue to shine brightly upon us,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们\N{\rEng}allowing us this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦想不灭\N{\rEng}this dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.85,0:02:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一个士兵也不会失去\N{\rEng}We will lose not one of our ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一个士兵也不会失去\N{\rEng}We will lose not one of our ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个也不会\N{\rEng}Not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们继续前行\N{\rEng}We move onward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下枪  立刻\N{\rEng}Guns down. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是亚历山大的瑞克啊\N{\rEng}So, you're the Rick from Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以来都是你\N{\rEng}This whole time, it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:04:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫人来这里毫无用处\N{\rEng}You called your men in for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗在外面\N{\rEng}The fight's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里只有我\N{\rEng}It's just me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到我刚才说的话了吗\N{\rEng}Did you hear what I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:07.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\rEng}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.75,0:04:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门开着  我通过镜子看到了\N{\rEng}I saw it in the mirror through the open door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不是旧日故人\N{\rEng}And it wasn't any kind of blast from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.58,0:04:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一看到你\N{\rEng}As soon as I saw you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就知道你跟我走过了同样的一段路\N{\rEng}I knew you'd made the same trip as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那里到这里\N{\rEng}From there to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Shit, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜我们都变了  对吧\N{\rEng}Well, I guess we aren't the same guys we used to be, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你就是个禽兽\N{\rEng}'Cause you're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫他们来  是因为抓你有奖  瑞克\N{\rEng}I called them back because you're a prize, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面吩咐过了\N{\rEng}We've been told.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能杀你  寡妇和国王\N{\rEng}We don't kill you, the Widow, or the King...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非不得不杀\N{\rEng}not if we don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么来这里  瑞克\N{\rEng}So why are you here, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.07,0:04:57.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解你\N{\rEng}I know you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:04:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就跟之前一样\N{\rEng}Just like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直是那个愿意冲在最前面的人\N{\rEng}You're always the guy willing to rush in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是为什么\N{\rEng}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在找什么\N{\rEng}What is it you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无话可说吗\N{\rEng}Nothing to say, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\rEng}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经不要紧了\N{\rEng}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.54,0:05:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你而言\N{\rEng}Not for you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对其他你带来的人而言都一样\N{\rEng}or anyone else you brought in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.53,0:05:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们这边剩下的人...\N{\rEng}'Cause what's left of my people...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要过来了\N{\rEng}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.44,0:05:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会把你送到尼根那里\N{\rEng}And we'll get you to Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者不会\N{\rEng}Or we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\rEng}Either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都会把你解决了  香饽饽\N{\rEng}we're gonna settle your shit, Peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  大家一起挺住了\N{\rEng}Come on, let's stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:46.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后撤\N{\rEng}Falling back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我冲了\N{\rEng}I'm going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停火  停火\N{\rEng}Hold fire! Hold fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.63,0:06:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫拉莱斯让我们进去\N{\rEng}Morales wants us back inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人员听我命令到院门那边去\N{\rEng}All force towards the courtyard door on my mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们停火了\N{\rEng}They stopped shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主翼需要火力支援\N{\rEng}On main flank, we need fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.03,0:06:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他们只是不朝我们开火了\N{\rEng}No, they stopped shooting at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后援在哪里\N{\rEng}Where's that backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背面遭到攻击\N{\rEng}Fire from the rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:20.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上  上  进去\N{\rEng}Go, go! Get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上\N{\rEng}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里  这里\N{\rEng}Here. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了  有我在\N{\rEng}It's okay. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:46.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  好了\N{\rEng}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在\N{\rEng}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.17,0:06:49.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况有多糟\N{\rEng}How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:54.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有子弹穿过的伤口\N{\rEng}There's an exit wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是好事\N{\rEng}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以把你送到神之国的医生那里去\N{\rEng}We can get you to the Kingdom's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直压着伤口就好\N{\rEng}We just have to keep pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃里克\N{\rEng}Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉...\N{\rEng}I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:25.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你开枪打的我吗\N{\rEng}Were you the one who shot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...\N{\rEng}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我把你卷了进来  你根本不想战斗的\N{\rEng}I pulled you into this. You didn't want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来想了\N{\rEng}Until -- Until I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须得帮助他们...\N{\rEng}You need to help them --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-什么  我不能...  -你必须得走\N{\rEng}- What? I can't -- - You need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我一个人在这也可以好好流血  -我不会抛下你的\N{\rEng}- I can bleed here fine on my own -- - I'm not leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别犯傻\N{\rEng}Don't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们需要你\N{\rEng}They need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚伦  看着我\N{\rEng}Aaron, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\rEng}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我爱你\N{\rEng}You know I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我是对的\N{\rEng}You know I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\rEng}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我站起来\N{\rEng}stand your ass up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.07,0:08:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到战场上去\N{\rEng}get back to the fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打赢这场仗\N{\rEng}and you win this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\rEng}I will. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\rEng}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\rEng}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就预感到了\N{\rEng}I always had a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rEng}Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我们回去  立刻报告玛姬\N{\rEng}When we get back, we'll talk to Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她知道该如何处置这些人\N{\rEng}She'll know what to do with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她知道\N{\rEng}She will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她清楚这些人做过什么\N{\rEng}Because she knows what they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不远了\N{\rEng}We're not far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离山顶寨不远\N{\rEng}From the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但应该离其他地方很远\N{\rEng}We're far from somewhere else, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们已经做了决定  -还没板上钉钉\N{\rEng}- We made our decision. - Nothing's been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划永远赶不上变化\N{\rEng}Well, nothing's permanent except impermanence, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:10:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这点我赞同\N{\rEng}In that way, I'll agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.89,0:11:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们要带他们去山顶寨\N{\rEng}But we are taking these men to the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我们的去处\N{\rEng}That's where we're going,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是我们的计划\N{\rEng}and that's what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这有多危险吗\N{\rEng}You know how dangerous this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.59,0:11:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人有多坏\N{\rEng}Who these people are?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论他们做过什么\N{\rEng}No matter what they've done...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.29,0:11:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们毕竟是人\N{\rEng}They're people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险有千万种\N{\rEng}There's many kinds of danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死法也各不相同\N{\rEng}many kinds of dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我杀人\N{\rEng}I kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.93,0:11:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀过人\N{\rEng}I've killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也杀人\N{\rEng}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀过人\N{\rEng}You have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们不处死他人\N{\rEng}But we don't execute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我处死过\N{\rEng}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.97,0:11:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你家人在这里吗\N{\rEng}Is your family here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没能抵达伯明翰\N{\rEng}We never made it to Birmingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没能\N{\rEng}They didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.65,0:12:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\rEng}Well, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当真吗  瑞克\N{\rEng}Really, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:12.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也失去了一些人\N{\rEng}I lost people, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛莉\N{\rEng}Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肖恩\N{\rEng}Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安德莉亚\N{\rEng}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\rEng}Glenn...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根杀了他\N{\rEng}Negan killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逼他下跪\N{\rEng}Forced him to his knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后当着我的面  当着他怀孕妻子的面\N{\rEng}Bashed his head in right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用棒子砸烂了他的头\N{\rEng}In front of his pregnant wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有妻子吗\N{\rEng}He had a wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前没有\N{\rEng}Not before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来才遇见的\N{\rEng}He met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.05,0:12:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在乱世中\N{\rEng}In this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  在乱世中\N{\rEng}Yeah. In this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:58.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是那个寡妇\N{\rEng}She's the Widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是尼根吗\N{\rEng}Are you Negan, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.07,0:13:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我失去家人\N{\rEng}I lost my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我丧失理智\N{\rEng}I lost my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我住在拖车里\N{\rEng}I was in some... tow trailer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醉生梦死\N{\rEng}sleeping myself to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:23.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对未来毫无期待\N{\rEng}Waiting to become nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但救世军\N{\rEng}And the Saviors --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们找到了我\N{\rEng}they found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们认为我还有用\N{\rEng}They thought I was worth a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,值得带我回去加入他们\N{\rEng}Worth bringing back with 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  没错\N{\rEng}So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是尼根\N{\rEng}Yeah, I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能生存至今\N{\rEng}To make it this far, this long,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯有这个办法\N{\rEng}I had to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须有所归属\N{\rEng}I had to be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-和你一样  -我们不一样\N{\rEng}- Just like you. - We're not the same. ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么不一样\N{\rEng}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.26,0:13:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你看看你  -看我\N{\rEng}- Well, look at you. - Look at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我们  瑞克\N{\rEng}Look at us, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.47,0:13:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我们\N{\rEng}Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.99,0:14:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就是两个为了生存不择手段的混蛋\N{\rEng}We're two assholes ?who'll do whatever we have to just to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.06,0:14:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的区别在于\N{\rEng}And the only difference is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手里握着枪\N{\rEng}I'm the one holding the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不代表我比你坏  瑞克\N{\rEng}That doesn't make me any worse than you, Rick --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是幸运一点\N{\rEng}that just makes me luckier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对现实吧\N{\rEng}'Cause let's face it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不是我\N{\rEng}if it wasn't me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.66,0:14:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换作是你拿着枪\N{\rEng}if it was you holding the gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就脑浆横流了\N{\rEng}I'd be brains out on the floor right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-这你不知道  -而你又知道吗\N{\rEng}- You don't know that. - And you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我不愿意那么做\N{\rEng}I know I wouldn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能再假一点吗\N{\rEng}Is that the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我至少会试着寻找其他办法\N{\rEng}I'd -- I'd at least try to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何必呢\N{\rEng}Yeah? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就因为我们早先认识过一两天吗\N{\rEng}'Cause we knew each other for a few days back at the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.81,0:14:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\rEng}Look, I know --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会...\N{\rEng}I-I wouldn't -- I wouldn't just --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.43,0:14:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么想吗\N{\rEng}You want to know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你可以随便怎么说\N{\rEng}I think you can talk all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.03,0:14:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便花言巧语\N{\rEng}You can say all the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛莉  肖恩  安德莉亚  格伦\N{\rEng}Lori, Shane, Andrea, Glenn...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们全死了\N{\rEng}They're all dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.08,0:15:05.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而早在某天某时\N{\rEng}and somewhere along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好警官也随他们一起死了\N{\rEng}Officer Friendly died right along with 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像我随家人死了一样\N{\rEng}Just like I did with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就这样想  瑞克\N{\rEng}That's what I know, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.29,0:15:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  不\N{\rEng}Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\rEng}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-那是...  -我知道他是谁\N{\rEng}- That -- t-that was... - I know who it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无所谓  一点关系都没有\N{\rEng}It don't matter. Not one little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.51,0:15:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到枪了吗\N{\rEng}You find them guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在这里\N{\rEng}They aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.26,0:15:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把救世军从院子叫了回来\N{\rEng}He called the Saviors back from the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要离开这里  趁...\N{\rEng}We gotta get out before --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\rEng}They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗  我一直想弄清楚\N{\rEng}You know, I've been trying to figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底有什么不同\N{\rEng}what's different about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.73,0:16:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为肯定有什么不同\N{\rEng}'Cause something's definitely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我终于弄明白了\N{\rEng}I think I finally got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.53,0:16:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的盔甲\N{\rEng}It's your armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不一样\N{\rEng}It's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:26.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更小\N{\rEng}Smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像...\N{\rEng}Almost like it --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.62,0:16:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缩水了之类的\N{\rEng}like it shrunk or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.80,0:16:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个孩子的吧\N{\rEng}Was that the kid's? It is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:42.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\rEng}Why the --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:44.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要穿这个\N{\rEng}Why the hell would you wear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又没能保护到他\N{\rEng}Didn't do shit for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.18,0:16:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山上有行尸\N{\rEng}Walker's on the hill!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:42.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走  快走  快走\N{\rEng}Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走  快走\N{\rEng}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟着他们  快点\N{\rEng}Follow 'em! C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有枪  别跑\N{\rEng}They got guns, huh? Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:08.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\rEng}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我可不想死在这里  -快点\N{\rEng}- Didn't make it this far to die! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.59,0:18:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\rEng}C'mon! C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-快走  -往左\N{\rEng}- Go! - Go left! Go left!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不  -等等\N{\rEng}- No! - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-起来  起来  -拉他起来  快\N{\rEng}- Get up! Get up! Get up! - Get him up! Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他拉起来\N{\rEng}Pull him up! Get him up! Get him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-等等  -起来\N{\rEng}- Wait! - Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开枪  求求你  我们投降\N{\rEng}Don't shoot! Please! We give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根  住手\N{\rEng}Morgan. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  站起来  快走\N{\rEng}C'mon. On your feet. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.44,0:18:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们逃跑了\N{\rEng}They ran off to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.03,0:18:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\rEng}Then what happens after?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们拦下了他们  -他们会继续逃\N{\rEng}- We stopped them. - And they keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一次又一次\N{\rEng}Again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.80,0:18:55.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  你以为他们会回来吗\N{\rEng}What? You think they were gonna come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:18:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会变吗\N{\rEng}That they will change?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.48,0:18:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会变成不一样的人吗\N{\rEng}That they will be something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会变的\N{\rEng}It doesn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:01.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不会变\N{\rEng}It never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-一旦变了...  -摩根\N{\rEng}- Once you turn -- ?- Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会找到别的方法\N{\rEng}We're gonna find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.34,0:19:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬会找到别的办法\N{\rEng}Maggie will find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真觉得她不会杀死他们吗\N{\rEng}Really think she won't want 'em dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不剩  在他们干了那么多坏事之后\N{\rEng}Every last one? ?After what they've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是他们\N{\rEng}And it isn't just them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们也站在这\N{\rEng}'Cause we're here now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:23.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这幅样子\N{\rEng}to be this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和他们做一样的坏事\N{\rEng}do the same thing they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们继续\N{\rEng}but we go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是一样的\N{\rEng}You see, we are the same --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-摩根  -我们是一样的\N{\rEng}- Morgan.- We're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是一样的\N{\rEng}We're the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以别无选择\N{\rEng}so there's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都会变  但我们\N{\rEng}Everybody turns, but w-we w--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有战争  之后就有和平\N{\rEng}There's war, and then there's peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争结束后我们要和这些人一起生活\N{\rEng}We're gonna have to live with these people after.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.89,0:19:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须找到和平共处的方法\N{\rEng}We're gonna have to find a way to peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.04,0:20:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\rEng}Morgan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听清楚了\N{\rEng}Make no mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被我们迅速消灭的那些人\N{\rEng}those we've so swiftly extinguished
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很可能只是三大基地的其中一支驻军\N{\rEng}are but perhaps one garrison in a compound of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:21:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们的首胜会带来第二次胜利\N{\rEng}But our first victory will allow our second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二次会带来第三次\N{\rEng}Our second will deliver our third.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  我们走\N{\rEng}Come on! Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.49,0:21:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全\N{\rEng}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他们\N{\rEng}It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.61,0:21:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边  走\N{\rEng}There! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.93,0:22:19.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在有点迷糊\N{\rEng}You're having a little trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.69,0:22:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想停手了吗\N{\rEng}You want to stop now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:44.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能还不想\N{\rEng}Maybe not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.52,0:23:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没子弹了\N{\rEng}I'm out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.50,0:23:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\rEng}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.71,0:23:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四人一组  搜索办公室\N{\rEng}Teams of four, sweep the offices!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.74,0:23:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-亚伦  -瑞克\N{\rEng}- Aaron! ?- Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.62,0:23:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在电梯旁边\N{\rEng}We're by the elevator!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.91,0:24:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了吗  摩根\N{\rEng}Is it over, Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.50,0:24:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了吗\N{\rEng}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.30,0:24:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.36,0:25:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不对\N{\rEng}I'm not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.99,0:25:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  我不对\N{\rEng}I know that -- I'm not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.90,0:25:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那不代表我错了\N{\rEng}But that doesn't make me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.75,0:25:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能参与其中\N{\rEng}I can't be a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.39,0:25:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\rEng}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\rEng}You are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.78,0:26:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他\N{\rEng}It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.71,0:26:20.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\rEng}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.27,0:26:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开门\N{\rEng}Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\rEng}I -- I need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.38,0:26:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃尽了苦头\N{\rEng}I've been through hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.31,0:26:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你在里面  我知道你能听见\N{\rEng}I know you're in there! I know you can hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.01,0:26:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  门坏了吗\N{\rEng}What, is the gate broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.93,0:26:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫他们上点油的\N{\rEng}I-I've told them to oil that --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.51,0:26:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门没坏\N{\rEng}The gate's not broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.29,0:26:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么开着加百利的车\N{\rEng}What are you doing with Gabriel's car?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.95,0:26:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\rEng}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.34,0:26:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你说的是谁\N{\rEng}I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车停在那我就开了\N{\rEng}The -- The car was just there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.79,0:27:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你来这做什么\N{\rEng}So what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.61,0:27:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我住在这\N{\rEng}I live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.96,0:27:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我家\N{\rEng}This is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.00,0:27:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我建了这个地方\N{\rEng}I built this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.24,0:27:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时不在\N{\rEng}Uh, you weren't here for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.50,0:27:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是有人可不是现在才蹦出来的\N{\rEng}but some of us didn't just show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.39,0:27:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴\N{\rEng}Shut your damn mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.52,0:27:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的打算站在那\N{\rEng}You're really gonna stand there and pretend
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.88,0:27:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假装自己没出卖我们\N{\rEng}you didn't try to sell us out,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.89,0:27:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没向救世军出卖这地方吗\N{\rEng}sell this place out to the Saviors?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.52,0:27:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是头脑清醒的\N{\rEng}I was working for the side of sanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.61,0:27:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我努力营造和平\N{\rEng}I was working for peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.00,0:27:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你威胁要把别人逐出这里\N{\rEng}You threatened to kick people out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.48,0:27:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要救人\N{\rEng}I tried to save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.52,0:27:27.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在这些人都成了炮灰\N{\rEng}Now those people are cannon fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.71,0:27:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人想通过抗争过上更好的生活\N{\rEng}Those people are fighting for a better life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.65,0:27:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  "驱逐全家"都是尼根的点子\N{\rEng}Look, the "Throwing out the families" Line was all Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他逼我说了那些可怕的话\N{\rEng}He made me say those horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.65,0:27:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去找他们  是是是\N{\rEng}I went to them in -- in -- in --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.12,0:27:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道的  是为了\N{\rEng}you know, in the interest of --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.16,0:27:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续诚信友好的外交往来\N{\rEng}of furthering good-faith diplomacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.27,0:27:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要救人\N{\rEng}I tried to save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.23,0:27:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些人\N{\rEng}Some people,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.89,0:27:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果没有被复仇洗脑\N{\rEng}without opinions colored by a preoccupation with vengeance,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.61,0:27:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会将之称为英雄行为\N{\rEng}might call that heroic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.33,0:27:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是为了你自己\N{\rEng}You were looking out for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.94,0:28:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是去背叛我们的\N{\rEng}You went there to betray us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.64,0:28:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去警告尼根我们要去攻击他们\N{\rEng}To warn Negan that we were gonna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.03,0:28:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把凯尔拽到那里时  就是这样告诉他的\N{\rEng}That's what you told Kal when you dragged him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.93,0:28:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以凯尔才抛下你走了\N{\rEng}It's why Kal left you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.94,0:28:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔  凯尔有妄想症\N{\rEng}Kal? Pfft. Kal is delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.64,0:28:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈说什么\N{\rEng}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.93,0:28:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\rEng}Kal!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.99,0:28:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了  兄弟\N{\rEng}Hey. C'mon, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.95,0:28:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道自己戏挺多的\N{\rEng}Y-You -- You know you can be dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.77,0:28:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高粱煎饼那事  记得吗\N{\rEng}That -- That thing with the sorghum, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.34,0:28:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你指你吃了一个小姑娘煎饼那事吗\N{\rEng}You mean when you ate a little girl's pancakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.35,0:28:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没吃那些煎饼\N{\rEng}I did not eat those pancakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.96,0:28:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  不管怎样\N{\rEng}Listen, for what it's worth,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.91,0:28:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有对你的目标造成任何负面影响\N{\rEng}I did exactly zero harm to your cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.51,0:28:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根早就全知道了\N{\rEng}Negan already knew everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.52,0:28:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见  格雷戈里\N{\rEng}Goodbye, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.77,0:28:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  不要  求你了\N{\rEng}Wait! No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.23,0:28:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我去那里是因为害怕\N{\rEng}I -- All right, I went there because I was scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.61,0:28:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行吗\N{\rEng}all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.74,0:28:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你们打算开战\N{\rEng}I knew you were going to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.95,0:28:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我  我并不想参与\N{\rEng}and -- and I didn't want to be complicit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.23,0:28:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我觉得你们赢不了\N{\rEng}Because I didn't think you could win.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.67,0:28:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我现在看到了  你早就看到的东西\N{\rEng}But I see now what -- what you saw all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.56,0:28:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了那些救世军根本不讲道理\N{\rEng}That -- That -- that the Saviors can't be reasoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.65,0:28:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实只能与他们开战\N{\rEng}That fighting them is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.32,0:29:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我错了\N{\rEng}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.23,0:29:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我犯了错  我很抱歉\N{\rEng}I-I-I made a mistake, and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.52,0:29:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了  玛姬\N{\rEng}Please, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.73,0:29:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都是普通人\N{\rEng}We're all just human beings
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.30,0:29:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会犯错误  有缺点  也有恐惧\N{\rEng}with faults and flaws and -- and fears!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.66,0:29:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你真是这样的人吗\N{\rEng}But i-is this who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.39,0:29:24.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫不仁慈\N{\rEng}H-Have you no mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.24,0:29:28.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无人性\N{\rEng}Have you no humanity?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.24,0:29:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无善心\N{\rEng}Have you no charity?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.02,0:29:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\rEng}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.02,0:29:32.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开门吧\N{\rEng}Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.44,0:29:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开你的心\N{\rEng}Open your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.15,0:29:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别眼睁睁看一个活生生的人死在外面\N{\rEng}Don't leave another human being out here to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.81,0:29:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放他进来\N{\rEng}Let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.55,0:29:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的那些所作所为...\N{\rEng}?With everything he did...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.63,0:29:54.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.16,0:29:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不值得杀他\N{\rEng}He's not worth killin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.81,0:29:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少现在不值得\N{\rEng}Not yet, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.02,0:30:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会后悔的\N{\rEng}You won't regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.45,0:30:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经改过了\N{\rEng}I've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.42,0:30:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在坚信不疑\N{\rEng}I-I'm a believer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.73,0:30:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会看到的\N{\rEng}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.87,0:30:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\rEng}Uhhh...Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.85,0:30:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不能让他们进来\N{\rEng}We are not letting them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.48,0:30:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不行\N{\rEng}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.95,0:30:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们过去做过的事\N{\rEng}With what they did?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.90,0:30:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的所作所为\N{\rEng}With what they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.36,0:30:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-他们就是禽兽  -格雷戈里\N{\rEng}- They are monsters! - Gregory...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.00,0:30:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  这里不是杀手的庇护所\N{\rEng}?No! This is not a sanctuary for killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.51,0:30:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是拿所有人的安全在冒险\N{\rEng}We'll be putting the safety of everyone in jeopardy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.27,0:30:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开\N{\rEng}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.76,0:30:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他们是什么人\N{\rEng}I know what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.14,0:30:28.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我亲眼看过...  -格雷戈里\N{\rEng}I have stared into the face of th-- Gregory!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.25,0:30:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\rEng}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.05,0:30:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了那么多  他居然回来了\N{\rEng}He actually came back after all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.75,0:30:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我居然放他进来了\N{\rEng}And I actually let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.60,0:30:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无意冒犯  耶稣\N{\rEng}No offense, Jesus,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.69,0:30:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我跟那个混蛋想法一样\N{\rEng}but I kind of agree with that prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.67,0:30:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许多人拖家带口在这里\N{\rEng}There are families here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.42,0:30:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多孩子\N{\rEng}Children.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.97,0:30:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面有两部空拖车\N{\rEng}There's two empty trailers out back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.93,0:30:53.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以把他们锁在里面\N{\rEng}We could lock them up in there
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.73,0:30:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派人日夜看守  直到事情过去\N{\rEng}with 'round-the-clock guards until this whole thing is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.05,0:30:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候再说\N{\rEng}And go from there...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.57,0:31:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他们怎么对待我们\N{\rEng}You know what they've done to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.08,0:31:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么掠夺我们\N{\rEng}What they've taken from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.52,0:31:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然知道\N{\rEng}Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.44,0:31:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们已经投降了\N{\rEng}But they surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.06,0:31:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶稣\N{\rEng}Jesus...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.73,0:31:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能放他们回去\N{\rEng}We can't let them go,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.35,0:31:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能杀他们\N{\rEng}and we can't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.80,0:31:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\rEng}We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.94,0:33:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\rEng}Aaron!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.23,0:34:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那\N{\rEng}He's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.03,0:34:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃里克在那\N{\rEng}Eric's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.51,0:34:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\rEng}I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.89,0:34:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\rEng}I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.40,0:34:40.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能就让他...\N{\rEng}I can't just let him...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.10,0:34:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\rEng}Aaron...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.19,0:34:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那已经不是他了\N{\rEng}that's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.62,0:34:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.76,0:34:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们得走了  -不  不\N{\rEng}- We gotta go. - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.89,0:34:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.10,0:35:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枪不在这\N{\rEng}Guns aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.97,0:35:13.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得立刻撤了  大家\N{\rEng}We gotta go right now, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.04,0:35:15.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会引开尸群\N{\rEng}They're gonna pull away the herd,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们也不能冒险\N{\rEng}but we aren't taking any chances!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.29,0:35:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在里面找到的吗\N{\rEng}She was inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.65,0:35:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}She was.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.92,0:35:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得\N{\rEng}I have a --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.15,0:35:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去一个地方  达里尔骑摩托\N{\rEng}I have a stop to make, and Daryl's got his bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.30,0:35:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你或斯科特可以带她回去\N{\rEng}Maybe she can go back with you or Scott...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.98,0:35:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带她吧\N{\rEng}She can go with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.17,0:35:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以送她去山顶寨\N{\rEng}I can, uh, t-take her to the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.23,0:35:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在那里比较安全\N{\rEng}She'll be safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.73,0:36:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\rEng}Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.80,0:36:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\rEng}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.08,0:36:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃里克和我本来\N{\rEng}Eric and I were gonna go up...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.16,0:36:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打算完事后去那边向玛姬汇报\N{\rEng}We were gonna go there after and update Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.67,0:36:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我就去吧\N{\rEng}So...that's what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.89,0:36:20.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.53,0:36:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须去\N{\rEng}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.85,0:36:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.63,0:36:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的名字叫格雷西\N{\rEng}Her name's Gracie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.76,0:36:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  格雷西\N{\rEng}Hey, Gracie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.78,0:36:45.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家见\N{\rEng}See you back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.23,0:36:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定你想一个人和那群混蛋交涉吗\N{\rEng}Sure you wanna talk to them assholes alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.85,0:36:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确定\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.25,0:36:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样才能成事\N{\rEng}That's how it gets done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.92,0:36:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  如果你太久没回来\N{\rEng}All right. You're gone too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.90,0:36:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就去找你\N{\rEng}I'm gonna come lookin' for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.24,0:36:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么定了\N{\rEng}That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.76,0:37:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂\N{\rEng}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.17,0:37:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂\N{\rEng}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.74,0:37:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是一个人\N{\rEng}You're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.35,0:37:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是的\N{\rEng}You got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.82,0:37:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树后面藏不下两个人\N{\rEng}There's not enough room for two of you behind that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.70,0:37:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且尸群要来了\N{\rEng}And there's a herd coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.26,0:37:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就说说\N{\rEng}I'm just sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.56,0:37:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不这样吧\N{\rEng}Hey, I tell you what...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.12,0:37:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们谈个交易\N{\rEng}...we'll make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.96,0:37:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放下枪  走出来\N{\rEng}You drop your gun and come on out --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.05,0:37:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说出我们想知道的事\N{\rEng}you tell us what we need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.39,0:37:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要这样做\N{\rEng}You do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.07,0:37:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就能开走一辆车\N{\rEng}you can take a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.42,0:37:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以走  你可以活\N{\rEng}You go. You live.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.14,0:37:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何\N{\rEng}How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.71,0:38:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我凭什么信你\N{\rEng}Why should I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.29,0:38:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我向你做出了承诺\N{\rEng}'Cause I'm giving you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.39,0:38:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今没多少有意义的东西\N{\rEng}There's not a lot ?that's worth much these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.58,0:38:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但一个男人的承诺\N{\rEng}but a man's word...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.47,0:38:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是有所意义的  对吧\N{\rEng}that's got to mean something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.34,0:38:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好...好吧\N{\rEng}O-O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.28,0:38:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想知道什么\N{\rEng}W-What do you wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.49,0:38:41.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这里有0.50勃朗宁重机枪吗\N{\rEng}You ever have any m2 Browning .50-caliber guns here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.70,0:38:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾有过一段时间\N{\rEng}We did. For a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.14,0:38:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枪哪去了\N{\rEng}What happened to 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.08,0:38:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天被调到另一个哨站了\N{\rEng}They got sent to another outpost yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.24,0:38:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪一个\N{\rEng}Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.41,0:38:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加文的哨站\N{\rEng}It was Gavin's --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.98,0:38:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里以西\N{\rEng}it's west of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.35,0:39:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能走了吗\N{\rEng}Can I, uh -- Can...Can I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.58,0:39:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪队人去了加文的哨站\N{\rEng}Which team's at Gavin's?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.61,0:39:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都在  陛下\N{\rEng}Everyone is accounted for, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.38,0:39:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以西结\N{\rEng}Ezekiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.23,0:39:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没死一个\N{\rEng}Not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.68,0:39:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得搜一遍基地\N{\rEng}We need to sweep the compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.28,0:39:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依你的建议和计划行事\N{\rEng}Your counsel, your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.55,0:39:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看\N{\rEng}Let me take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.41,0:40:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然我们要在这里待一会儿\N{\rEng}If we're gonna be here a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.06,0:40:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如顺手把它们解决了\N{\rEng}might as well take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.90,0:40:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正都要解决的  哥们\N{\rEng}We should do it either way, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.64,0:40:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我们  就是他们\N{\rEng}We or they.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.63,0:40:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死我活\N{\rEng}One or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.40,0:40:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能...\N{\rEng}It cannot be --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.81,0:40:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-快散开  -掩护国王\N{\rEng}- Scatter, now! - Cover the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.80,0:40:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
